0120: Darwin 27's eight new system calls on xnu-12377, so that iOS 27's libsystem_kernel finds them: pipe2, dup3, fchflagsat,
getumask, aio_readv and aio_writev (ENOTSUP for now), fsctlat, guarded_ftruncate_np (docs/ios27-starlte.md). Numbers and argument
counts as read from the iOS 27.0.1 kernel's system call table; the code is Scion's own.
Scion's change to Apple's xnu, under the APSL 2.0.

